{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0064_1000_044miz", "source_sha256": "eb1793319d6073f4bef719ea55cf15cc71c1666b205c23a232cf4d84a543e1d2", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\nナイスタイミング。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\nNice Timing。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0064_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b52b2a4dafed5c63892cc27a3c4bc776bbbc467fd58aad0d424af359fd275131", "ja": "どうした、瑞希。\n新しい衣装で、何か気に入らないところがあったか？", "zh": "瑞希，怎么了？\n新的服装有什么不满意的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0064_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "60afe7ca69cb8842baff9eedfa024c3e8a930c01fdf25f6ee20e6827237677d1", "ja": "いえ、気に入らないところはありません。大丈夫です。\n……あ、大丈夫ではないです。", "zh": "没有，我没有哪里不满意，没有问题。\n……啊，也不能说没有问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0064_1003_p", "source_sha256": "aa8d15968232438ef748faa0a73a1ffd2e0cc72bc8689e6acbcc44b1469a3cd4", "ja": "……どっちなんだ？", "zh": "……到底是怎样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0064_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "91e137bb1dc4ab3e79093eb71213e30e663f9ad00a8cad65e77f42acde24f0be", "ja": "すみません。新しい衣装が嬉しくて、\n気分が浮ついているようです。", "zh": "对不起，我太喜欢这套新服装了，\n感觉整个人都有点浮躁。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0064_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "72c0e2980ba423f422200340b60dea76641ac3dcd1353396e45ca0fc4835a33f", "ja": "この衣装を着る度、こんなふうに\nなってしまうのでしょうか。……心配だな。", "zh": "我是不是只要换上这套服装，\n就会变成这副德性？真令我担心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0064_1006_p", "source_sha256": "93eb9be5d07db5b7f019953b934ca064290cee8cb3c5ca813ec98e5fcd03f3d9", "ja": "なんだそんなことか……大丈夫じゃないか？\n衣装を着る瑞希が嬉しいなら、それが一番だ！", "zh": "原来是这种小事啊……没什么好担心的吧？\n瑞希穿上这套服装觉得开心，这才是最重要的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0064_1007_p", "source_sha256": "bd39f630b3efb36f02bfcea466cc08c23a12184f6683d02adae82d6a56613386", "ja": "ブログも読んだけど、ファンのみんなにも好評だし。\nそんなに気にしなくて大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "我也看过部落格了，看来粉丝们也都很喜欢。\n你不用这么介意啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0064_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "2e367da4f3d9d93fb66de78312c99ee87d965fdcde47c8efed90f962d52c61b5", "ja": "そうですか。……{$P$}、\nもうひとつ心配なことがあるのですが。", "zh": "这样啊……{$P$}，\n我还有另一件担心的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0064_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "de10f8d7fac684829d7903d716f8ca5423e6cbc7c3d10486b998f1f79e1efca8", "ja": "私の笑顔を、見てもらえますか。\n次のライブに向けて、今、練習しているところなので。", "zh": "可以麻烦你看看我的笑容吗？\n为了下次的演唱会，我正在练习怎么笑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0064_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "e3a368cfe1728bc0a49e9cb498a5f4e5bae7446852fdd4f08c47526a88c2619d", "ja": "それでは、いきます。……にこっ。", "zh": "那么，我要上了……（微笑）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0064_1011_p", "source_sha256": "7f385ac40d7938969e5985421df23361082223c062a5b0fe0eb84920e8fbee4d", "ja": "う、うーん。\nちょっと、ぎこちないかな……。", "zh": "呃，该怎么说……\n好像有点僵硬呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0064_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "ab799b0b83abef0e931236ef70db44448d12e5d9e9f0b91a3da46a7cbc1a8b99", "ja": "そうですか。……しゅん。", "zh": "这样啊……（失落）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0064_1013_p", "source_sha256": "95253321ef63a48b603d86670e426e321efc20836a7e2935caabc24a57814827", "ja": "ま、まぁまぁ……練習なんかしなくても、\n瑞希には瑞希だけの笑顔があるんだから。", "zh": "别、别在意啦……用不着刻意去练习，\n瑞希是有自己的笑容的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0064_1014_p", "source_sha256": "cff2b171deb8e2fc2096a2e701e1db750bacc7e42ae4f6149651c08c559b6404", "ja": "自分ではなかなか気付けないと思うけど、いつも\nちゃんと笑えてる。みんなも、きっとわかってるよ。", "zh": "这只是当局者迷，你其实都有好好露出笑容。\n大家一定也都明白这点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0064_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "6ad44c6b040b9c4f9c3e9cf8bde51a025db49422f39b00481334b9be9dd82e8b", "ja": "{$P$}……。わかりました。\n……私には、私だけの笑顔。", "zh": "{$P$}……我知道了。\n……我有属于自己的笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0064_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "30e2a4e913303cef73e96f09672107856cbbd565de396a74cacb9aa917793607", "ja": "私が感じている、嬉しい気持ち……楽しい気持ち。\nファンのみんなにも、伝わるといいな。", "zh": "希望我高兴的感受……快乐的感受，\n都能传达给台下的粉丝们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
